WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.470
But... not yet...

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.490
I will protect you... no matter what.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:31.670
Mid-Summer’s Love

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:31.670
Ichigo’s Swaying Heart

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:41.680
Go!

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.310
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:56.410
I can’t beat them this way!

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.300
This is gross!

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.800
It’s over. No one will save you now.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:18.970
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:27.480
Stop that!

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.450
Zakuro...oneesama!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:41.500
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.080
Who the hell are you?

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:26.960
Who knows... obviously not your ally!

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.510
Interesting.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.630
Reborn... Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.220
What?

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.820
Don’t bother me here!

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:53.980
Fuu-Rai-Sen!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.950
I thought you were abroad!

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.740
I felt somewhat uneasy...

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.460
I bet their aim is to disperse us.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.170
We have to save the others.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.260
Yes!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.440
Who are you? Why did you save Ichigo?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:34.150
TELL me!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:37.440
Monsters!

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.450
Hurry everyone! Run!

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:40.400
Run away!

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:48.750
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.420
Reborn... PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.840
There are too many of them!

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:02.840
We can’t win!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.390
Go!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.230
They’re after us!

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.520
Retasu-oneechan, in a situation like this...

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.370
What should we do?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.120
We should RUN!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.740
Don’t come any closer!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.960
Gross!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.250
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.710
Reborn... Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:48.600
Damn you!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.980
Zakuro-san, why are you here?

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:53.810
Minto-oneechan came too!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.320
I’ll explain later, first we have to save Ichigo.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.610
Let’s go!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:01.530
Hey, wait!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.400
Hey, wait!

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.570
Geez, why am I even talking?!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.870
What are you doing?

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.160
The enemy will escape!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.670
Aaah! What’s going on here?!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.550
Who... who are you?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.650
There’s no need for you to know...

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.900
Why did you save me?

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.650
Are you a Mew Mew?!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.440
Take that!

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.490
What do you have to do with Ichigo?!

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:06.310
Have... we... met before?

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.470
Please, tell me everything!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.770
Now is not the time for that...

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.650
But...

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.940
Wait... I have so much to ask...

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.070
Wait!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.740
Wait!!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.250
I don’t understand... Why...?

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:50.300
Ichigo is MY toy! Hands OFF!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.570
What?!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.450
Everyone!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.000
Oh, who is that?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.250
It’s a cool guy!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.040
I’m not asking how he looks!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.880
Quiche, what are you doing?

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.930
Who is that guy?

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.100
I don’t know.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.180
Fuu-Rai-Sen!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:43.990
You’re a lot heavier than you look...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:49.650
Go... Mew Strawberry...

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.820
I won’t forgive you!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.160
StrawberBell!!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.860
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.660
Retreat!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:29.870
Damn!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.160
Mew Strawberry!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.910
You did it!

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.330
Oh, your arm!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:43.000
I’m fine... I will protect you.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.420
Eh?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.750
I was born to protect you...

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.980
That person...

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:02.350
Who is he?

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.490
Mysterious...

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:06.700
Ichigo!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.440
Ichigo... are you ok?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:12.950
Shirogane...

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.820
Hang in there!

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:20.620
Ichigo!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.220
Ichigo!

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.400
What’s wrong, Keiichirou?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.760
Isn’t it about time to open the café?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:38.720
Ryou!

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:45.890
I’ve been analyzing the video recorded by Masha...

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.780
Keiichirou, can we drop
that topic for now?

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:53.360
Anyway, let’s drop it for now...

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.820
Ryou? Why...?

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.080
Please...

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:07.410
That “Blue Knight” must have been
an alien! His ears were like this!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:11.380
But why would an alien save Ichigo?

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:17.670
Ever since then... I feel like I know him...

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.460
Eh?

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:24.720
Though, he didn’t seem like a normal
guy when he saved you.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:30.430
That’s true... I don’t think I know anyone like him.

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:31.690
I’ve got it!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:32.400
Ohh?

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:35.440
The Blue Knight’s true self is...

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.820
Shirogane-oniichan!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.330
What!??

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.790
Everyone remember! Back then...

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:51.000
Right after the Blue Knight left, Shirogane came running.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.080
In other words;

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.080
In other words??

00:10:54.080 --> 00:11:00.510
after the fight, the criminal hid behind a wall...

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:07.220
...and changed his clothes so he wouldn’t be revealed.

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:09.770
“Ichigo, are you ok?”

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:13.440
See? It was a great feat!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.150
Lately, I’m frightened by my deductive skills.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:19.230
You know, he’s not a criminal! Not a criminal...

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:22.150
I believe you’re a little off-topic there.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:24.610
That story is way off...

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:26.950
Hey! What’s that supposed to mean?!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:29.920
Shirogane....

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.460
Ichigo?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.420
Your face is red.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:45.140
Eh? What?

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.350
My face is not red!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.190
Shirogane!

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:52.520
What’s wrong? Your face is all red.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.900
No it is not!

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.190
What’s with her?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.910
Shirogane-oniichan!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:04.990
It’s been proven, so admit it!
You’re the Blue Knight!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.830
Blue Knight? Who’s that?

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.870
You don’t know him?

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:14.410
He was the one who saved Ichigo
that day, right before you came.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:18.170
Oh, really? I didn’t see him.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.250
Bu-Ling feels so empty...

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:24.680
Bu-Ling’s speculation turned out
to be a failure in the end!

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.850
Don’t cry about something like that.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:31.310
Bu-Ling, I think your speculations were great!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:34.480
Whatever the case, we’re opening soon...

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.520
...hurry and get everything ready.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:49.580
<i>If you’re in trouble,
I’ll protect you for sure.</i>

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.540
Aaaah geez!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:59.580
What if, it really was Shirogane who protected me then?

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:01.840
Ichigo, it’s for you.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.760
Coming...!

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:08.880
It’s from someone who “suddenly stopped by yesterday.”

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.140
Huh? Who?

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.760
A-o-ya-ma-kun!

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:16.230
Well done! You cute girl, you got yourself a boyfriend!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.640
Ooh don’t say that! Now, please go...

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:19.480
Sure, sure...

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.400
Hello?

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.320
Ah, Ichigo? Did your cold get better?

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.200
Yes, I’m better now... Thanks.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.530
That’s good.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:32.530
Sorry about yesterday...

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.880
It’s ok. Don’t worry about it.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:40.670
And... that promise, to go out, I didn’t forget about it...

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.670
Want to give it another try?

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:45.420
Wuahhh! Sure!!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:49.590
Well then... The day after tomorrow,
same place. Is that ok?

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:53.350
Got it! I’m so happy!
Thanks Aoyama-kun!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.310
See you then.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.770
Yup, byebye...

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:00.890
Yay! A date with Aoyama-kun!

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:01.730
Date! Date!

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.270
Aaah, youth...

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:05.570
I’m back!

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:06.740
Coming...

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:11.740
Who was that... that guy?

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.740
Right now we can only guess.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.420
What’s more important is,

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:19.820
Deep Blue ordered us to concentrate on eliminating the humans.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:23.080
This is why we came to the Earth.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:26.430
So Pie, have you ever seen Deep Blue?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.800
I don’t see the point
of your question.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:32.890
He’s giving us directions and only letting us hear his voice.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.530
I wonder if he can succeed with his revenge that way...

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.560
What?

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.810
And until now...

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:42.780
why doesn’t he give his tribe, who suffers in this terrible environment, a hand?

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:47.280
Bastard! Are you going to insult our great leader?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.440
That’s unreasonable.

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:53.620
I’m just saying: I don’t believe in
something I haven’t even seen.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.450
What are you saying?

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.610
Someone whose true-self
we don’t know...

00:14:57.610 --> 00:15:01.370
it’s the same case with the Blue Knight and Deep Blue.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:03.040
Don’t you think so?

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.090
Whatever the case...

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:10.260
they were against us, weren’t they? Let’s beat them!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.260
Yeah, you’re right.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.780
Thanks for waiting! Here’s your Marron
Chante and Strawberry Blanc Mange!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.280
Ichigo is working so enthusiastically.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.400
She’s been nervous since yesterday...

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.610
I wonder what happened...

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.610
Hmm, I’m curious...

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:37.200
Bu-Ling-san acting as detective again?

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.380
Follow me, Mr. Watson!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.670
Aoyama-kun... I wonder if he’ll be here soon.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.420
It can’t be, Shirogane?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:53.220
So he really is here to protect me...?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:56.760
Huh?

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.020
Ichigo?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.770
Ah! Aoyama-kun!

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:03.690
Good morning...

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:08.110
What were you looking at?
Where do you want to go today?

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.860
An amusement park!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.370
Are you ok? What’s wrong?

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:28.670
Oh hahaa~! I tripped...

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.460
You’ve been daydreaming, huh?

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.470
Sorry... well, let’s go.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.240
Ichigo, aren’t you thirsty?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.240
Now that you mention it...

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.530
Wait here a second, I’ll go buy something to drink.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.500
OK!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:10.260
What? What am I thinking about...?

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.590
Ichigo?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.880
Were you thinking about something?

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.930
N-no... not really.

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:18.830
You’re acting odd...

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:19.840
Here!

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:20.680
Thanks.

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:23.470
Your cold isn’t over yet, perhaps?

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.560
No, I’m fine.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.690
...it’s nothing, sorry...

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.980
Is it about Shirogane-san?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.440
Eh? How come you...

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:37.150
I kind of had a feeling...

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:40.120
No, you’re wrong. Shirogane is just a...

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.160
Ouch!

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.750
B-Bu-Ling!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:47.870
Bu-Ling-chan...

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:48.420
Ehh?

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.460
Are you alright?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:51.380
Retasu?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.630
What are you doing here?

00:17:56.340 --> 00:18:00.430
You’ve been acting strangely since
the day before yesterday...

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:06.230
Retasu-oneechan and I have been
investigating the reason...

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:15.400
Ichigo, it’s true you’ve been acting
strangely since morning.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.110
I’m... sorry.

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:20.780
You don’t need to apologize.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.950
Your friends are worried too.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:28.800
It might be better if you talk to them about it today.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.920
Aoyama-kun...

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.960
Well, I’ll leave here and head home.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.710
Sorry... I’m really sorry about today...

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:40.970
Stop apologizing...
I’ll see you at school...

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:42.980
Bye-bye.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:47.060
Is this ok, Ichigo-san?

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.440
Sorry for disturbing your date...

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:52.940
It’s ok... It was my fault.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:59.740
I’ve been having weird thoughts all day
and wasn’t paying attention.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:04.030
That wasn’t nice to Aoyama-kun who was right next to me.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.320
Weird thoughts?

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:06.790
What do you mean?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:13.130
You see, I really do believe the
Blue Knight was... Shirogane!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:14.630
Ehhh??

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:17.340
<i>You’re a lot heavier than you look...</i>

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.550
So it WAS as I suspected!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:27.180
But why did Shirogane transform?

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.520
I don’t know that myself...

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:32.100
Anyway, let’s keep this as a secret... OK?

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.270
OK...

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.270
Bye...

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.360
See you tomorrow...

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.780
And it was as I suspected...

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.200
It’s still early...

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.370
I’ll finish up everything for tomorrow.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.130
OK! Let’s start...

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:02.590
Are you alone?

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.470
Hmm? Yeah...

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:08.050
What do you want?

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:11.310
Listen, do you want to go to the beach?

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.730
You’re kidding...

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:25.850
It’s terrible!

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:28.060
Ichigo-oneechan is acting really scary.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.020
She looks scared and stiff in her swimsuit.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.520
...What on earth is going on?

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:35.840
She must have planned to make a debut
in it, that’s why she brought it along.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:37.670
It doesn’t look like that...

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.260
But why then does she have a swimsuit?

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:44.280
That’s why we decided to come to
the beach instead of the pool.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.700
Let’s go to the sea, let’s go......

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:50.210
Next: “The power of kindness;
O Wish, come true deep in the sea!”

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:52.680
I wanna go swimming too!
